#. module: tier_validation_digest
#: model_terms:digest.tip,tip_description:tier_validation_digest.digest_tip_tier_validation_order
msgid ""
", a higher <i>Sequence</i> is reviewed first. Tick <i>Approve by "
"sequence</i> to make each tier wait for the one before it, and <i>Notify "
"reviewers on reaching Pending</i> so reviewers only get an email when it is "
"their turn."
msgstr ""
", una <i>Secuencia</i> más alta se revisa primero. Marque <i>Aprobar por "
"secuencia</i> para que cada nivel espere al anterior, y <i>Notificar a los "
"Revisores sobre la recepción de Pendientes</i> para que los revisores solo "
"reciban un correo cuando les toque."

#. module: tier_validation_digest
#: model_terms:digest.tip,tip_description:tier_validation_digest.digest_tip_tier_validation_four_eyes
msgid ""
", tick <i>Four-eyes Principle</i>: the person who requested the validation "
"then cannot approve it, even when they are in that group."
msgstr ""
", marque <i>Principio de los cuatro ojos</i>: quien solicitó la validación "
"no podrá aprobarla, aunque pertenezca a ese grupo."

#. module: tier_validation_digest
#: model_terms:digest.tip,tip_description:tier_validation_digest.digest_tip_tier_validation_exceptions
msgid ""
"A document under review is locked, so what is approved is what goes through."
" A"
msgstr ""
