#. module: tier_validation_digest
#: model_terms:digest.tip,tip_description:tier_validation_digest.digest_tip_tier_validation_reject_reason
msgid ""
"When you reject a document, a short reason in the comment saves a round of "
"questions: the requester sees it in the chatter of the document and knows "
"what to change."
msgstr ""
"Cuando rechaza un documento, un breve motivo en el comentario ahorra una "
"ronda de preguntas: el solicitante lo ve en el chatter del documento y sabe "
"qué cambiar."

#. module: tier_validation_digest
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:tier_validation_digest.action_my_validated_tier_reviews
